-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.2 (2026-11-01)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * No change but Lean Code: built with the lean toolkit 0.1.21, whose C and C++
    files lose their comment-only lines, with no #line directive and no empty
    line where a comment was; dpkg-stereo --resolve finds a lean line's
    authored line by its content (ORDER 334); 0.1.1 kept every authored line
    (toolkit 0.1.18, ORDER 311)

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 0.1.1 (2026-10-31)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * No change but Lean Code: built with the lean toolkit 0.1.18, whose C and C++
    files keep every authored line with no #line directive, a removed comment
    leaving the line breaks it held (ORDER 303); 0.1.0's sources carried 203
    #line directives of toolkit 0.1.9 (ORDER 311)

